      "message": "docs(decisions): the hole bridge also feeds dive_room\n\nThe first commit called the fill display-only. motion::entry::dive_room\nalso reads Region::triangles to choose the dive point. Each candidate is\nstill checked with contains and boundary_clears.\n\nRefs #2762\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
